    "name": "BER MSc - Empirical Arrival Demand - All Core Proxies",
    "description": "MSc derivative of Istvan Koren's Airport Ground Handling (Extended). Finite BER same-aircraft paired demand; literature-informed single-aisle service times. NOT a validated digital twin. Layout, resource capacities, weather and remaining process times are inherited fictional assumptions. Six parallel handling threads. Input timestamps are airborne boundary proxies, not ALDT/AIBT. Departure observations are external evaluation targets, never simulator timing inputs. See README and the companion *_manifest.json.",
